    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Release v5.21.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Model additions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;MiniCPM-OCR&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MiniCPM-OCR is a document-understanding model from OpenBMB's MiniCPM-V family. It keeps the MiniCPM-V 4.6 architecture, which pairs a SigLIP vision encoder and a window-attention merger with a Qwen3.5 language model. It is specialized for reading text-dense images such as scanned pages, screenshots, receipts and tables.&lt;</ns0:content>
